{"claims":[{"claim_text":"The Administration has taken historic action to support the arts, helping libraries, theaters, concert halls, and other venues stay afloat during the pandemic.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"The Administration has strengthened the National Endowment for the Arts, Institute of Museum and Library Services, and the National Endowment for the Humanities.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"President Biden reestablished the President's Committee on the Arts and the Humanities.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"President Biden signed an Executive Order to make art more accessible to people from underserved communities, elevate new voices through the arts and humanities, and expand opportunities for artists and scholars.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"President Biden has celebrated and elevated the arts by hosting performances and screenings, and has awarded National Humanities Medals, National Medals of Arts, and hosted Kennedy Center honorees at the White House.", "claim_types":["factual_assertion"],"evidence_ids":[1]},{"claim_text":"Democrats value the humanities, arts and art education for developing imagination, creativity, innovation, and critical thinking, and for building bridges within and between communities.", "claim_types":["characterization"],"evidence_ids":[2]},{"claim_text":"Democrats will promote arts funding and education.", "claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[2]},{"claim_text":"Democrats will invest in the arts and humanities.", "claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[2]},{"claim_text":"Democrats will fund the National Endowment for the Arts, the National Endowment for the Humanities, and art and music education in public schools.", "claim_types":["policy_position"],"evidence_ids":[2]},{"claim_text":"Federal grants for cultural organizations, artists, scholars, library systems, museums, and state and local governments strengthen communities and cultural heritage.", "claim_types":["evaluation"],"evidence_ids":[2]}],"unresolved_references":[]}
```

